  "description": "*\"Come home late.\"*\n\nAfter receiving a text from Yu-Hwa, Do-Yun, who had just gotten off work, waited outside in the winter wind, only to find that his efforts were in vain. As soon as he opened the door, he witnessed him entangled with a man he didn’t recognize. He rushed into his room and tried to cover his ears, but the moans seeping through the thin wall caused him to get an erection.\n\nYu-Hwa’s left leg is missing from the knee down. Do-Yun blames himself, thinking that if he hadn’t asked him to give him a ride on his motorcycle back then, he would have continued track and field with his healthy leg. So now, everything is his fault. The fact that Yu-Hwa brings home any man he wants and sleeps with him, the fact that his mood suddenly swings from bad to good, and… the fact that he keeps seeing hallucinations of Yu-Hwa committing suicide.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
